      "content": "it’s not just something i can \"work through\" with a therapist. there's no going back. my career, my family, even just walking into a grocery store... it's all gone. i feel like a ghost. people look right through me or they look at me with so much disgust. it's like the version of me that actually lived died months ago. i'm just a shell of a person now.",
